# News engine (news.thematicquran.com) — entire folder is its own private
# git repo (thematicquran-news-private); the news site deploys from THAT
# repo's public/ folder via a separate Cloudflare Pages project. The main
# repo never tracks anything under news/.
news/

# Thematic Qur'an Expert Council — internal design/advisory tooling and its
# simulated-panel run outputs (panel_runs/). Keep private; this is not part of
# the public site and must never be pushed to the public repo. The skill that
# drives it is ignored too, since it exposes the council's existence and usage.
thematic-quran-expert-council/
.claude/skills/advisory-panel/

# Raw tafsir corpus (large, regenerable from the QF API; provenance is in each
# compiled section's source_hashes). Back up to R2 if you want it preserved.
